description: Once per day, read and follow the skill enforce-templaterepo-baseline-security. Follow it again the same day when a stack path such as infra/ appears.
alwaysApply: true
---

Once per day in a git repository, read and follow the skill `enforce-templaterepo-baseline-security`. The same day, follow it again when a path appears that was absent at the last check, including `infra/`, `bootstrap/`, `prisma/`, `tests/`, `src/app/api/`, and `src/components/`.

That skill decides what to create, what to ask, and what to leave alone.
